{{!
    @template local_oksigeniafamily/consent_ask_pick

    Before the letter, on the site: whose families. The courses under way and the cohorts this person can ask, as
    chips that open the letter with them, and a search by name.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * action - Where the search goes.
    * q - What was searched.
    * coursestitle - The heading of the courses.
    * hascourses, courses - Each with name, countlabel and url.
    * hascohorts, cohorts - Each with name, countlabel and url.
    * more - Whether there are more than those shown.
    * none, nonetext - Nothing to show, and what to say then.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "action": "#", "q": "", "coursestitle": "Cursos en marcha",
        "hascourses": true, "courses": [{"name": "Armonía", "countlabel": "24 alumnos", "url": "#"}],
        "hascohorts": true, "cohorts": [{"name": "Alumnado de 1.º", "countlabel": "38 alumnos", "url": "#"}],
        "more": false, "none": false, "nonetext": ""
    }
}}
<div class="local-oksigeniafamily">
    <div class="okf-ask-pick">
        <h2>{{#str}} consent:pick, local_oksigeniafamily {{/str}}</h2>
        <form class="okf-ask-search" method="get" action="{{action}}" role="search">
            <label class="visually-hidden sr-only" for="okf-ask-q">{{#str}} consent:pick:search, local_oksigeniafamily {{/str}}</label>
            <input class="form-control" type="search" id="okf-ask-q" name="q" value="{{q}}" placeholder="{{#str}} consent:pick:search, local_oksigeniafamily {{/str}}">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">{{#str}} search {{/str}}</button>
        </form>
        {{#hascourses}}
        <h3>{{coursestitle}}</h3>
        <ul class="okf-ask-chips list-unstyled m-0">
            {{#courses}}
            <li><a class="okf-ask-chip nav-link" href="{{url}}">{{name}} <small>{{countlabel}}</small></a></li>
            {{/courses}}
        </ul>
        {{/hascourses}}
        {{#hascohorts}}
        <h3>{{#str}} consent:pick:cohorts, local_oksigeniafamily {{/str}}</h3>
        <ul class="okf-ask-chips list-unstyled m-0">
            {{#cohorts}}
            <li><a class="okf-ask-chip nav-link" href="{{url}}">{{name}} <small>{{countlabel}}</small></a></li>
            {{/cohorts}}
        </ul>
        {{/hascohorts}}
        {{#more}}<p class="okf-ask-note">{{#str}} consent:pick:more, local_oksigeniafamily {{/str}}</p>{{/more}}
        {{#none}}<p class="okf-ask-note">{{nonetext}}</p>{{/none}}
    </div>
</div>
